From b99da74c9ee928e533f25e5ee402eb70fdaebc4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LightCraft additional extensions <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:11:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Module bar (Library | Develop | Print | Export) and a
 full-window Print module
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Library and Develop map onto the photo grid and the detail view with the
Edit panel; Print shows the print settings and page preview in the window,
with Photo Size > Size by long edge (default 10 in) laying out one centred
cell per photo through the print.* commands; Export opens the Export dialog.
Module keys follow Lightroom Classic (Cmd+Alt+1/2/6). Print labels get their
own translation context (zh-Hans: 纸张, 纵向/横向) and the print settings are
translated into Simplified and Traditional Chinese.
